  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna programmet &#xe4;r tre&#xe5;rigt med m&#xe5;let att bygga             motst&#xe5;ndskraft genom att st&#xe4;rka pastoralisters, jordburkares och      semiurbana hush&#xe5;lls produktiva kapaitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention is a 3 year programme focusing to           contribute to resilience building by enhancing the productive         capacities of pastoral, agro-pastoral and peri-urban households and   communities in selected locations</narrative>
  </description>
